    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>315364</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ノルン！
どこにいんだよ！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Norn! You're
here, aren't you!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>315440</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Couleur&gt;？
どこ行くんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Couleur&gt;? Where
are you going?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>315540</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>よくぞ、
あなたは自分たちの罪を
受け入れました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You've done very
well, accepting your
sins as you have.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>315604</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Couleur&gt;……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Couleur&gt;...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>315692</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>まさか……
&lt;Couleur&gt;がノルンさん……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't tell me...
&lt;Couleur&gt; is Norn...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>315788</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ずっとあなた方を
そばで見させてもらいました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>From beside you, I've
watched over your
entire journey.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>315984</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ノルン！　ぼくに
この子たちを育てさせたのは、
全部今日のため？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Norn! Did you really
make me raise these
kids just for this?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>315984</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ふたりに、
自分たちの手で、罪を
償わせるためだったんですか！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Just so they could
"pay for their sins,
by their own hands"!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>316140</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうです。
ここまでの旅もすべて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Just so. And your
entire journey until
now, as well...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>316140</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>その罪に向き合う覚悟を
育てるために私が与えた試練</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...has all been an ordeal,
to prepare them to
face their sins.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>316216</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どうして……そんな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why... How could you...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>316288</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_013&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ひどいと思いますか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Do you find it horrible?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>316372</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_014&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ひどいよ……
ひどすぎます……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It is horrible...
It's far too cruel...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>316484</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_015&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ならば、あなたが
彼らの因果の糸をつなぐ
結び目になりますか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then, will you become the
knot that ties the threads
of their fates back together?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>316584</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_016&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>精霊であるあなた。
その魂を使えば
ふたりは助かる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You, a spirit. Were
I to use your soul,
they could be saved.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>316660</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_017&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>代わりにあなたが消える</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And you would
die in return.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>316720</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_018&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>エト！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ethos!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>316868</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_019&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……ふたりが消えたくない
って言うなラ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...If they said they
want to live, then...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>316868</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_020&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ぼく、喜んで、
この身を捧げます！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I would gladly
offer myself
up for them!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>316928</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_021&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>エト！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ethos!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>316988</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_022&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>やめて！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Stop this!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>317212</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_023&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも……これが
ふたりの決断なら……
ぼくはその覚悟を受け止める</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But... If this is their
decision... Then I
have to accept it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>317212</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_024&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>つらいよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It hurts...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>317212</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_025&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>きみたちを
失いたくはないよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't want
to lose you...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>317212</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_026&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>317304</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_027&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>子どもたちを救うのは
親ではないのですか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is it not the role
of a parent to
save their children?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>317400</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_028&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>子どもたちのした決意を
尊重するのも親です</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's also a parent's
role to respect their
child's decisions.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>317476</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_029&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それが間違った決意でも？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Even if those decisions
should be wrong?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>317640</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_030&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>もうふたりが間違ってるか
どうか、判断するのは
ぼくじゃないんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's not my place to
decide right and wrong
for them, anymore.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>317640</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_031&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ふたりはもう
それができる……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They can do that
themselves, now...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>317736</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_032&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わたしたちは、
覚悟を決めました。
だから……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We're prepared
for this. So...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>317824</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_033&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>もう、エトは関係ない！
エトを離せ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Leave Ethos out of
this! And let her go!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>317984</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_034&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>エトス、
本当にそれで
よいのですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ethos. Are you
truly okay with this?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>317984</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_035&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ふたりの存在は、
彼らの未来はここで
失われるのです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Here and now, they will
cease to exist. They will
lose their future.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>318064</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_036&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;と&lt;Mel&gt;の、
未来……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Dio&gt; and &lt;Mel&gt;'s...
future...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>318164</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_037&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>『なりきり士』として、
ふたりが見ていた未来です</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The future they saw before
them, as "Roleplayers."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>318228</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_038&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>もうやめて！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>STOP IT!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>318292</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_039&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>エトを……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>LET GO...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>318364</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_040&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>イジめるなぁあっ！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...OF ETHOS!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>318444</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_041&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;、
エトを取り戻すぞ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We're taking
her back, &lt;Mel&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>318508</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_042&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うん……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>318676</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_043&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ご覧なさい。彼らは
あなたを取り返すために、
私に立ち向かおうとしています</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Look at them. They would
even stand against me, just
to ensure your return.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>318676</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_044&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>愚かだと思いませんか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is it not foolish?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>318764</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_045&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……&lt;Dio&gt;と&lt;Mel&gt;を
バカにするな！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Don't you dare
look down on them!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>318852</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_046&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うぉおおおっ！
やぁああっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hooooooh!
Yaaaaaah!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>319008</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_330_010_048&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>戦うと言うのならば、
受けて立ちましょう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If it's a fight you want, then
a fight you shall receive.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Notice</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>84476</PointerOffset>
